From 298eb259b79d8402705d85d28e320dc709a96384 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 17:09:33 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 07/27] venus: consume paired protocol headers from an explicit
 build directory

---
